     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    <p>Jack</p>\r\n    <p>Thanks for the report on Distance and OS X.  Happy to hear all\r\n      runs smoothly.  Just added to the website.<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <div>On 08/07/2016 20:38, Jack Lawson Ph.D.\r\n      wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Good afternoon,</span>\r\n      <div><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br>\r\n        </span></div>\r\n      <div><span style=\"font-size:12px\">thought you\r\n          might like to update the web page indicating how to run\r\n          Distance on other operating systems.  I am running the latest\r\n          version of Distance on the latest Mac OS X 10.11.5 (El\r\n          Capitan) (on a MacBook Pro with 16 GB of RAM). I am using\r\n          Parallels software (version 11) to run Windows XP, but again\r\n          Apple&#39;s bootcamp, and the latest Virtual PC and </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.333em\">VMware\r\n          Fusion emulators also work.</span></div>\r\n      <div><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br>\r\n        </span></div>\r\n      <div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n              <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                  <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                      <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                          <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                              <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                  <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                      <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                          <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                              <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                                  <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                                      <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-variant:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;border-spacing:0px\">\r\n                                                          <div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n                                                          <div style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font color=\"#0B44DB\">my regards,    Jack</font></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font style=\"font-size:12px\" color=\"#0B44DB\"><br>\r\n                                                          </font></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font style=\"font-size:12px\" color=\"#0B44DB\">(from\r\n                                                          GMail account)</font></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font style=\"font-size:12px\" color=\"#0B44DB\"><br>\r\n                                                          </font></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">And\r\n                                                          the night\r\n                                                          shall be\r\n                                                          filled\r\n                                                          with music,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">\r\n                                                          <span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">And\r\n                                                          the cares,\r\n                                                          that infest\r\n                                                          the day,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">\r\n                                                          <span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">Shall\r\n                                                          fold their\r\n                                                          tents, like\r\n                                                          the Arabs,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">\r\n                                                          <span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219)\">And\r\n                                                          as silently\r\n                                                          steal away.</span></span></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219);font-size:12px\"><br>\r\n                                                          </span></div>\r\n                                                          <div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(11,68,219);font-size:12px\">    \r\n                                                                       \r\n                                                             Lord Byron</span></div>\r\n                                                          </div>\r\n                                                        </span></div>\r\n                                                    </span></div>\r\n                                                </span></div>\r\n                                            </span></div>\r\n                                        </span></div>\r\n                                    </span></div>\r\n                                </span></div>\r\n                            </span></div>\r\n                        </span></div>\r\n                    </span></div>\r\n                </span></div>\r\n            </span></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <br>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </blockquote>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <pre cols=\"72\">-- \r\nEric Rexstad\r\nResearch Unit for Wildlife Population Assessment\r\nCentre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling\r\nUniversity of St. Andrews\r\nSt. Andrews Scotland KY16 9LZ\r\n<a href=\"tel:+44%201334%20461833\" value=\"+441334461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a>\r\nThe University of St Andrews is a charity registered in Scotland : No SC013532</pre>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
